<title>USA: Independence continues stock buy back plan.</title>
<headline>Independence continues stock buy back plan.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independence Holdings Co said Tuesday its board has approved the continuation of its share repurchase program and authorized it to buy up to 750,000 shares of its common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>The company said it has bought about 1.7 million shares at a cost of $8.3 million since it began its repurchase program in 1991.</p>
<p>The company said the 750,000 shares represents about 10 percent of the shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said the timing and price of the purchases will be at the discretion of the management.</p>
</text>
